<headroom-rig>
<metadata preset-name="Master of Puppets Rhythm" preset-author="Headroom" preset-comment="Mid-80s thrash rhythm: a tight, saturated boutique lead channel with a V-shaped EQ (deep lows, scooped mids, crisp highs), a gate and a 4x12. Built for downpicked palm mutes and fast chromatic riffs." based-on="" based-on-path=""/>
